    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-a2ccea018238aed2",
      "path_or_url": "docs/guide/workers.md",
      "section": "Workers > Workers > Work decorator",
      "snippet": "The addition of `@work(exclusive=True)` converts the `update_weather` coroutine into a regular function which when called will create and start a worker.\nNote that even though `update_weather` is an `async def` function, the decorator means that we don't need to use the `await` keyword when calling it.\n\n",
